2 v3.3.0\n\n   Both are fully rolled out, healthy, and their error rates are down to 0.2%.\n2. **Incident INC-0001 (SEV2):** It's open and filed under payments-api, and the summary covers both services and both rollbacks. The first attempt to create it timed out. I checked that nothing had been created before trying again with the same duplicate-protection key, and there's only one incident.\n\n**Your call:** You asked for \"the affected service,\" singular, but both had bad releases with matching error rates. I rolled back both because each was going back to a version that had already been healthy in production. The release history doesn't show which one was this morning's deploy, so one may be the cause and the other just affected by it. If you only wanted one rolled back, I can put the other back on its newer version. Neither newer version has been healthy in production, though, so I'd hold off until the root cause is known.", "type": "text"}]}]}